# The software trace of the ORTI demo (zed/aurix_tcf_demo/build_orti.ps1 -Trace, started with
# start_in_flash, RAM only): aurix_trace.h records on RTT channel "SwTrace" (BinaryLE), the ids
# named in tc275_orti_trace.trace. Each task runs a slice of 0.4 s, the timer ISR every 10 ms.

attach ../../dap-client/examples/tc275_orti_trace.json
continue all
# What the target kept while nobody read (and its "dropped" record) comes first: forget it.
sleep 1s
trace clear

trace expect timer_isr count >= 50 within 2s
trace expect timer_isr interval avg >= 9.9ms
trace expect timer_isr interval avg <= 10.1ms
trace expect timer_isr span max < 20us
trace expect dispatch count >= 3 within 2s
trace expect TaskA span last >= 399ms within 3s
trace expect TaskA span last <= 401ms
trace expect TaskC span max <= 401ms within 3s
# The reader kept up: nothing dropped since the clear.
trace expect dropped == 0
